# Build artifacts. There is one of each, at the repository root: every
# part writes into build/<part>/ and drops finished programs in bin/.
# Anchored with a leading slash so a build/ or bin/ appearing anywhere
# else is a mistake that shows up in git status instead of hiding.
/build/
/bin/

# Editor and OS noise.
*~
*.swp
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store

# Compiler leftovers, in case anything is ever built outside build/.
*.o
*.d
*.a
